  "body": "Our motivated vendors have secured their next property and are ready to make their move. All genuine offers are invited for consideration - this is an opportunity not to be missed.\r\n\r\n164 Hurstmere Road presents a rare and versatile offering, blending lifestyle, income, and future potential in the heart of Takapuna. Positioned on a 214sqm (approx) freehold site, this exceptional property includes a beautifully presented three-bedroom, one-bathroom apartment upstairs, plus two well-positioned retail shops at street level. Privately set back, the spacious apartment features open-plan living and dining that flows seamlessly to a charming balcony and landscaped garden-perfect for relaxing or entertaining. The location is second to none, just a short stroll from Takapuna Beach, vibrant cafes, restaurants, boutique shopping, and the Takapuna Surf Club.\r\n\r\nWith increasing demand for both residential and commercial assets in Takapuna-alongside major developments in the area-this property is a smart acquisition for investors, developers, or lifestyle buyers seeking long-term value.\r\n\r\nKey Features:\r\n- Outstanding dual-income opportunity - live upstairs, lease the shops\r\n- Three-bedroom apartment + two ground-floor retail spaces\r\n- Exceptional rental return potential\r\n- Add-value and future development prospects\r\n- Moments to the beach, shops, and local amenities\r\n- A rare offering in a blue-chip coastal suburb\r\n\r\nStrictly available by private appointment - contact me today to arrange a viewing or register your interest.",
